[0m[0m
[38;5;10mtranslation/tests/differential.rs[0m has 14 tests that spawn both binaries, pipe identical stdin, and assert stdout, stderr and exit status all match. Coverage includes empty input, a single item, the 99-byte [38;5;10mfgets[0m maximum and lines past it, all 256 byte values on each side, a reject byte at every index of 98–101-byte lines, embedded NULs, CRLF, and 1200 deterministic random inputs biased toward the length boundaries.[0m[0m
